Good — the convention in this project (RDCenter) is to hoist static config with i18n sub-keys into module-level constants, and use `$t('ns.sub.' + item.key)` in templates. I'll follow a similar approach for Production: tabs with keys.

For Production, I can follow that exact pattern:

```js
// 工厂分类：文案走 i18n（key 为 production.tabs.* 的子键）
